{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108422","id":2651086855,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6eBGAH","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108422","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108422.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/108422.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108422","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108422/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/108422/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108422/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a281e91c5a8a4790d087ece1e0666f887c4b9b78","number":108422,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Metal: Fix `texture_get_data` other linear formats","user":{"login":"stuartcarnie","id":52852,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyODUy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52852?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie","html_url":"https://github.com/stuartcarnie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stuartcarnie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Introduce a specialised `texture_get_data` for `RenderDeviceDriver` API, which is responsible for retrieving the texture data from the GPU driver for shared textures (`TEXTURE_USAGE_CPU_READ_BIT`).\r\n\r\nVulkan and D3D12 continue to use the `texture_map` API, which has been copied from `RenderDevice` to each implementation. Metal uses the `getBytes:` API to read each mip level.\r\n\r\n## APIs\r\n\r\nGiven that `RenderingDeviceDriver::texture_map` and `RenderingDeviceDriver::texture_unmap` are only called internally by the `texture_get_data` function, arguably, these can be removed as virtual functions from `RenderingDeviceDriver`, so Metal doesn't have an incomplete implementation.\r\n\r\nCloses #108115\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097519,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1MTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:ios","name":"platform:ios","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097780,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc3ODA=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:macos","name":"platform:macos","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":